DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     uussbbddeevvss prints a listing of all USB devices connected to the system with
     some information about each device.

     The options are as follows:

     --aa _a_d_d_r     Only print information about the device at the given address.

     --dd _u_s_b_d_e_v   Only print information for the given USB controller.

     --vv          Be verbose.  Multiple --vv options increase the verbosity.

